Developed an interactive **E-Commerce Sales Analysis Dashboard** using Microsoft Excel to analyze and visualize business sales performance and customer purchasing behavior. The project focuses on converting raw sales data into meaningful business insights through **data cleaning, PivotTables, PivotCharts, Excel formulas, and interactive visualizations**.

The analysis covers **total sales revenue, total orders, quantity sold, purchase/cost analysis, returned orders, return rate, product performance, category-wise sales, month-wise sales trends, state-wise sales performance, and gender-wise shopping behavior**. It also identifies the **best-selling products, highest-performing months, top-performing states, and customer segments contributing the most to sales**.

The dashboard provides a clear overview of overall business performance and helps understand **which products sell the most, when sales are highest, where customers are located, how returns affect the business, and which customer groups contribute most to revenue**.

**Tools & Skills Used:**
Microsoft Excel • Data Cleaning • Excel Formulas • PivotTables • PivotCharts • Data Analysis • Data Visualization • Dashboard Creation • Business Insights
